    "items": [
      {
        "type": "heading1",
        "verse_numbers": [],
        "lines": [
          "Descendants of Benjamin"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          1
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Benjamin’s first son was Bela, the second was Ashbel, the third was Aharah,"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          2
        ],
        "lines": [
          "the fourth was Nohah, and the fifth was Rapha."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          3
        ],
        "lines": [
          "The sons of Bela were Addar, Gera, Abihud,"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          4
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Abishua, Naaman, Ahoah,"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          5
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Gera, Shephuphan, and Huram."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          6
        ],
        "lines": [
          "The sons of Ehud, leaders of the clans living at Geba, were exiled to Manahath."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          7
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Ehud’s sons were Naaman, Ahijah, and Gera. Gera, who led them into exile, was the father of Uzza and Ahihud."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          8
        ],
        "lines": [
          "After Shaharaim divorced his wives Hushim and Baara, he had children in the land of Moab."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          9
        ],
        "lines": [
          "His wife Hodesh gave birth to Jobab, Zibia, Mesha, Malcam,"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          10
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Jeuz, Sakia, and Mirmah. These sons all became the leaders of clans."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          11
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Shaharaim’s wife Hushim had already given birth to Abitub and Elpaal."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          12
        ],
        "lines": [
          "The sons of Elpaal were Eber, Misham, Shemed (who built the towns of Ono and Lod and their nearby villages),"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          13
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Beriah, and Shema. They were the leaders of the clans living in Aijalon, and they drove out the inhabitants of Gath."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          14
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Ahio, Shashak, Jeremoth,"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          15
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Zebadiah, Arad, Eder,"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          16
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Michael, Ishpah, and Joha were the sons of Beriah."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          17
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Zebadiah, Meshullam, Hizki, Heber,"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          18
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Ishmerai, Izliah, and Jobab were the sons of Elpaal."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          19
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Jakim, Zicri, Zabdi,"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          20
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Elienai, Zillethai, Eliel,"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          21
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Adaiah, Beraiah, and Shimrath were the sons of Shimei."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          22
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Ishpan, Eber, Eliel,"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          23
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Abdon, Zicri, Hanan,"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          24
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Hananiah, Elam, Anthothijah,"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          25
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Iphdeiah, and Penuel were the sons of Shashak."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          26
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Shamsherai, Shehariah, Athaliah,"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          27
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Jaareshiah, Elijah, and Zicri were the sons of Jeroham."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          28
        ],
        "lines": [
          "These were the leaders of the ancestral clans; they were listed in their genealogical records, and they all lived in Jerusalem."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "heading1",
        "verse_numbers": [],
        "lines": [
          "The Family of Saul"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          29
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Jeiel (the father of Gibeon) lived in the town of Gibeon. His wife’s name was Maacah,"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          30
        ],
        "lines": [
          "and his oldest son was named Abdon. Jeiel’s other sons were Zur, Kish, Baal, Ner, Nadab,"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          31
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Gedor, Ahio, Zechariah,"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          32
        ],
        "lines": [
          "and Mikloth, who was the father of Shimeam. All these families lived near each other in Jerusalem."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          33
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Ner was the father of Kish.",
          "Kish was the father of Saul.",
          "Saul was the father of Jonathan, Malkishua, Abinadab, and Esh-baal."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          34
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Jonathan was the father of Merib-baal.",
          "Merib-baal was the father of Micah."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          35
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Micah was the father of Pithon, Melech, Tahrea, and Ahaz."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          36
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Ahaz was the father of Jadah.",
          "Jadah was the father of Alemeth, Azmaveth, and Zimri.",
          "Zimri was the father of Moza."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          37
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Moza was the father of Binea.",
          "Binea was the father of Rephaiah.",
          "Rephaiah was the father of Eleasah.",
          "Eleasah was the father of Azel."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          38
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Azel had six sons: Azrikam, Bokeru, Ishmael, Sheariah, Obadiah, and Hanan. These were the sons of Azel."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          39
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Azel’s brother Eshek had three sons: the first was Ulam, the second was Jeush, and the third was Eliphelet."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          40
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Ulam’s sons were all mighty warriors and expert archers. They had many sons and grandsons—150 in all.",
          "All these were descendants of Benjamin."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      }
    ]
  },
